pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
elements:
  - elementId: p9-kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 34, 300, 20]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      text: "09 · 实验结果与统计"
  - elementId: p9-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 56, 864, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      text: 不是个别数据集刷分：系统领先且统计显著
  - elementId: p9-header-line
    elementType: line
    bounds: [48, 102, 864, 2]
    viewBox: [1, 1]
    points: "0,0 1,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: p9-fig
    elementType: image
    bounds: [48, 118, 420, 220]
    src: "media/F4_accuracy.png"
    fit: {mode: contain}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: p9-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 342, 420, 18]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: "图 4 · 14 方法 × 20 数据集分类精度性能剖面"
  - elementId: p9-fig2
    elementType: image
    bounds: [492, 118, 420, 220]
    src: "media/F13_friedman.png"
    fit: {mode: contain}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: p9-caption2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [492, 342, 420, 18]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: "图 5 · Friedman 平均秩：KDS-EL 1.90 第一（越低越好）"
  - elementId: p9-s1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 372, 280, 68]
    content:
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:18px; color:$primary; font-weight:bold;">Friedman 均秩 1.90</span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:4px; font-size:11px; color:$muted;">20 个数据集上的平均排名第 1；NoPool 2.95，MEL+MI 5.55，领先差距明显</p>
  - elementId: p9-line1
    elementType: line
    bounds: [48, 444, 864, 1]
    viewBox: [1, 1]
    points: "0,0 1,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: p9-s2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [344, 372, 280, 68]
    content:
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:18px; color:$accent; font-weight:bold;">Wilcoxon 20/20</span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:4px; font-size:11px; color:$muted;">对 MEL 等 4 个方法 20/20 全胜；对 FWPSO 19/20；去掉 TPS 后 13/20</p>
  - elementId: p9-s3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 372, 280, 68]
    content:
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:18px; color:$gold; font-weight:bold;">Holm 13/13</span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:4px; font-size:11px; color:$muted;">校正多重比较后，对全部 13 个对比方法仍然显著，排除偶然性</p>
  - elementId: p9-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 448, 864, 16]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 12
      text: |
        <p>在 8 个精度已接近天花板的强数据集上，KDS-EL 仍以 <strong>39–83 个特征</strong>全面占优。</p>
  - elementId: p9-concl-line
    elementType: line
    bounds: [48, 468, 864, 1]
    viewBox: [1, 1]
    points: "0,0 1,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: p9-concl
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 478, 864, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>多目标方法特征省但精度略低，单目标方法速度快但特征太多；KDS-EL 在<span style="color:$accent;">精度、稀疏性、效率</span>三个维度同时领先。</p>
  - elementId: p9-footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [890, 516, 40, 18]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 11
      align: [right, middle]
      text: "10"
